        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Creating an Integrated Supply Chain in Retail Grocery"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                47,
                9,
                725,
                28
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "With the ongoing expansion of online retail, consumers want more convenience and a wider selection of fresh products, which have shorter shelf lives—putting more pressure on the entire supply chain. This pressure is pushing retailers' cost and service metrics in the wrong direction and boosting tension between retailers and their CPG suppliers."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                50,
                30,
                729,
                50
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "But what if they dealt with this pressure by looking at the supply chain together and using digital tools to collaborate?"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                50,
                51,
                717,
                61
            ]
        },
